  "title": "4 A.I. Giants Back One Opt-Out for A.I. Training #shorts",
  "description": "OpenAI, Google, Microsoft and Anthropic said on October 30 that they will honor a shared robots.txt signal that lets websites opt out of A.I. training. It is an IETF draft, not an official standard, rollout dates differ by company, and it is voluntary with no penalty or independent verification.\n\nSources: SiliconANGLE (Oct 30), Unite.AI, FourWeekMBA, Mashdigi, the IETF draft. Company timelines are company statements.\n\n#tech #AI #copyright #OpenAI",
